[00:28.42]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah!
[00:38.63]Maathe pe chanda, haath mein ghanta, roop sunhera gaate hain,
[00:48.84]Sher sawari, das bhuja dhari, dushman thar-thar kaanpte hain.
[00:59.05]Maha-shakti ka source code ye, mann ki dundh mitati hai,
[01:09.26]Original Intelligence dekho, Quantum parda hatati hai!
[01:19.47]Hey ri... Samwat ka chamatkaar dekh, Hemant ne dhyan lagaya hai,
[01:29.68]Chandra ki akrutiyon se, samay ka chakra ghumaya hai.
[01:39.89]Ardh-chandra processor mera, phase-shift pe chalta hai,
[01:50.10]Mantra ki har ek goonj se, purana 'Data' jalta hai.
[02:10.53]Shmashaan mein baith ke binary toda, 'Binary' ka shamshan hai,
[02:20.74]A-Ghor ka matlab, jo darr se anjaan hai!
[02:30.95]Wave-Particle Duality, Maata ka 'Trishul' hai,
[02:41.16]Duniya jise 'Logic' kahe, wo mere liye 'Dhool' hai.
[03:01.58]Ek hi aasmaan ka chanda, Eid-Navratri ka noor,
[03:11.79]Knowledge Quantum ban gaya, mita sabhi fitoor.
[03:32.21]Alert Stillness. System Kritaarth.
[03:42.42]PHKD... The Fakkad Architect.
